The results in this folder concern the simulation of the envelope of the electric field E and of the plasma electron density rho

To simulate the results, we proceeded as follows. The coordinate system was z, x, and t. 

Then we applied the FFT Strang split scheme. 

And then we did a sweep from Pin = 0.1 * Pcr to 20 * Pcr, with increments of 0.1 * Pcr
